# Project Context

Project name:
PR Intelligence Platform

Goal:

Build a system that collects historical pull requests from large open source repositories and performs automated analysis.

The system is NOT a GitHub bot.

The system MUST NOT post comments to public repositories.

Primary purpose:

- collect pull requests
- collect review comments
- collect diffs
- collect metadata
- perform AI analysis
- compare AI findings with human reviews
- build benchmark datasets

Target repositories:

- django/django
- pandas-dev/pandas
- numpy/numpy
- golang/go
- kubernetes/kubernetes

The project should be developed as a portfolio-quality engineering project.

The codebase must prioritize:

- maintainability
- readability
- testability
- modularity

The project is expected to evolve toward:

- AI Code Review
- Review Benchmarking
- Multi-Agent Analysis
- Research Platform